#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.py:docstring of pyvista_js.mesh.PolyData.clean:3
msgid "This filters coincident points into a single point and rebuilds the cell connectivity accordingly. Point data arrays are preserved by keeping the value of the first occurrence of each merged point. It mirrors the PyVista ``clean`` filter API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.py:docstring of pyvista_js.mesh.PolyData.clean:10
msgid "The merge is computed in Python with NumPy. Points are merged when their coordinates are equal (or within ``point_tolerance`` when it is greater than zero)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/mesh.py:docstring of pyvista_js.mesh.PolyData.clean:14
msgid "Tolerance used to decide whether two points are coincident. The default of 0.0 merges only points that are exactly equal."
msgstr ""

